{'symbol': 'C', 'date': '2022-04-19 16:42:00', 'title': "CITI 2022 ANNUAL STOCKHOLDERS' MEETING", 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CITIGROUP INC. WILL HOLD ITS 2022 ANNUAL STOCKHOLDERS' MEETING ON TUESDAY, APRIL 26, 2022, AT 9 A.M. EASTERN TIME (“ET”). THIS YEAR'S ANNUAL MEETING WILL BE HELD VIRTUALLY. A LIVE WEBCAST OF THE ANNUAL MEETING WILL BE AVAILABLE AT WWW.VIRTUALSHAREHOLDERMEETING.COM/CITI2022. TO PARTICIPATE IN THE VIRTUAL ANNUAL MEETING: IF YOU ARE A STOCKHOLDER, YOU OR YOUR PROXYHOLDER CAN PARTICIPATE, VOTE, ASK QUESTIONS, AND EXAMINE OUR STOCKLIST OR RULES OF THE MEETING AT THE VIRTUA"}